"The bracket that contains the whole quantity prices all of it (450 kg in «up to 500» = 450 × its\n"
"                    price). Cumulative brackets (each part at its own price) are not supported."
msgstr ""
"El tramo que contiene la cantidad total la cobra entera (450 kg en «hasta 500» = 450 × su precio). Los tramos acumulativos (cada parte a su precio) no están soportados."

#. module: boss_pricing
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:boss_pricing.field_boss_tariff_line__on_request
msgid ""
"The document says 'on request': there is no amount; the quotation shows it as pending."
msgstr ""
"El documento dice 'a consultar': no hay importe; la oferta lo muestra pendiente."

