"The quantity is outside the brackets of the supplier document: ask the supplier."
msgstr ""
"La cantidad está fuera de los tramos del documento del proveedor: consulte al proveedor."

#. module: boss_pricing
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/boss_pricing/models/boss_pricing.py:0
msgid "The supplier document says 'on request' (%s): ask the supplier."
msgstr ""
"El documento del proveedor dice 'a consultar' (%s): pregunte al proveedor."

#. module: boss_pricing
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:boss_pricing.field_boss_tariff_line__free_of_charge
msgid ""
"The supplier document says this service costs nothing. Without it, a price without amount is 'missing', never 'free'."
msgstr ""
"El documento del proveedor dice que este servicio no cuesta nada. Sin esta marca, un precio sin importe es «falta precio», nunca «gratis»."

#. module: boss_pricing
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:boss_pricing.field_boss_tariff_line__uom_id
msgid ""
"The unit of the quotation line this price serves: container, B/L, shipment, kg... There is no conversion between charge bases."
msgstr ""
"La unidad de la línea de oferta a la que sirve este precio: contenedor, BL, expediente, kg... No hay conversión entre bases de cobro."

#. module: boss_pricing
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/boss_pricing/models/boss_pricing.py:0
