#: model:ir.model.fields,help:boss_pricing.field_boss_tariff_line__round_undecided
msgid ""
"Time-based prices: the document says «per 100 kg» without «or fraction» and the business has not decided: both readings are computed and the price is automatic only when they agree."
msgstr ""
"Precios por tiempo: el documento dice «por 100 kg» sin «o fracción» y el negocio no lo ha decidido: se calculan las dos lecturas y el precio es automático solo si coinciden."

#. module: boss_pricing
